5. Derived Binary Artifact: include/kudroid/framework_dex_bytes.h
===============================================================================
The header file include/kudroid/framework_dex_bytes.h is a compiled binary
artifact generated by compiling all Java sources in framework/ into a single
Dalvik Executable (framework.dex) using D8/R8 and embedding the resulting byte
stream.

It is a combined work containing compiled representations of:
- KuDroid MIT framework stubs and shims (632 classes)
- AOSP Apache-2.0 core utility classes (30 classes)
- Apache Harmony Apache-2.0 math, regex, text, and calendar classes (109 classes)
- OpenJDK GPLv2+CPE utility classes (7 classes)
